 <bodymatter>
  <level1 id="ch1">
   <h1>The Ferry</h1>
   <pagenum id="p1" page="normal">1</pagenum>
   <p>The ferry leaves at seven. Café tables fill early, and the señor at the counter pours coffee without asking.<noteref idref="#n1">1</noteref></p>
   <level2>
    <h2>Morning Tides</h2>
    <p>Gulls argue over crusts; everyone says “good morning” in three languages.</p>
    <list type="ul"><li>Bread from the bakery</li><li>Smoked fish</li></list>
    <sidebar><hd>Tip</hd><p>Arrive early for a window seat.</p></sidebar>
    <imggroup><img src="pier.png" alt="A pier at dawn"/><caption>The pier at dawn</caption></imggroup>
   </level2>
