  <level1 id="ch2">
   <h1>The Return</h1>
   <pagenum id="p3" page="normal">3</pagenum>
   <p>Prices — in euros — are posted by the quay.</p>
   <note id="n1"><p>Posted prices change with the season.</p></note>
